# This directory stores position risk information for each market

# Files are created automatically by the market_making_bot.py
# Format: <condition_id>.json

# Example content:
# {
#   "time": "2026-01-29 12:00:00",
#   "question": "Will BTC reach $100k in January 2026?",
#   "msg": "Selling 50 because spread is 0.02 and pnl is -5.5",
#   "sleep_till": "2026-01-29 14:00:00"
# }

# This directory should be:
# - Persistent in production (use PersistentVolume)
# - Backed up regularly
# - Monitored for anomalies
# - Cleaned up periodically (old files)

# Do not commit position files to git (they may contain sensitive trading data)
*.json
!.gitkeep
